name: media-transcribe
description: "Use when the user wants the transcript of a video that media-fetch already saved, or asks to re-run speech-to-text on it — 「重做逐字稿」、「換個模型轉一次」、「這個資料夾轉逐字稿」, or \"redo the transcript\", \"transcribe this folder\". Runs the media-transcribe script, then fixes whisper's name and look-alike mistakes with a small and a medium agent when the transcript is English speech-to-text. Never downloads and never summarises: a question about what the video says is the video-summary skill, which calls this one."
